{"unit_id":"zypchloe-del__dsh-wallpaper#card-zh","repo":"zypchloe-del/dsh-wallpaper","commit":"855fdcbc5fa6429cbee5fe48da3dcc1fa0ad6c9e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wallpaper 是为 DSH 网页界面更换壁纸的客户端插件。它通过浏览器界面添加可拖动的壁纸按钮和设置面板，上传图片后将其铺满页面背景，并让聊天区域和侧边栏透出可调透明度的壁纸。用户可以移除壁纸、调整透明度和按钮位置；图片会按屏幕尺寸处理，壁纸及透明度保存在 IndexedDB，按钮位置保存在 localStorage，刷新后恢复。适合希望个性化 DSH 网页背景的用户；无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:6-10","lib/client.js:103-163","lib/client.js:361-423","lib/index.js:4-8"]}
{"unit_id":"zypchloe-del__dsh-wallpaper#card-en","repo":"zypchloe-del/dsh-wallpaper","commit":"855fdcbc5fa6429cbee5fe48da3dcc1fa0ad6c9e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-wallpaper lets DSH web users set a page background. Its browser client adds a draggable button and panel to upload or remove an image, adjust chat opacity, and restore the wallpaper from IndexedDB after refresh. Button position is saved in localStorage. No API key or account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:6-10","lib/client.js:103-163","lib/client.js:361-423","lib/index.js:4-8"]}
